    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this stunning 5 bed, 3.5 bath, 3 storey, double fronted, end of terrance, modern home. Presented in showhouse condition throughout. Boasting a sunny south facing, landscaped rear garden. Set at the end of a cul de sac with 2 designated parking spaces (plus visitor parking spaces).\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall, guest wc, livingroom, extended kitchen / dining room and utility room. On the first floor there are three bedrooms, one ensuite and a bathroom. On the second (/top) floor there is a further 2 bedrooms, interconnecting shower room and study/home office.\n\nThe location is excellent. Set in a modern, new development that is very well-finished and landscaped including green areas and a playground. Set close to all local amenities including schools, shops, parks, and public transport including bus & DART giving a great link to & from Dublin City Centre. The M1/M50 road network is close by as well as Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.15m x 2.75m\nBright and welcoming entrance hall featuring timber effect tiled floor, recessed lighting, alarm control panel, and a composite front door.\n\nLiving Room - 3.8m x 5.05m\nBright and spacious living room featuring timber effect tiled floor, recessed lighting, TV point, and French doors providing direct access to the rear garden.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.15m x 7.4m\nModern fitted kitchen featuring quartz countertops and a breakfast counter, with integrated appliances including a double oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer, and dishwasher. The room is finished with timber effect tiled floor, recess lighting and benefits from a door providing direct access to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.7m x 2.25m\nPractical utility room featuring timber effect tiled floor, with washing machine, tumble dryer and freezer.\n\nGuest WC - 1.6m x 1.45m\nWell-appointed guest WC featuring timber effect tiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, and heated towel rail.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 4.85m x 1.0m\nBright landing area featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a convenient hot press.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.25m x 3.4m\nSpacious double bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 2.7m x 1.55m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.75m x 2.5m\nDouble bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring fitted wardrobe and laminate-effect timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.6m x 2.3m\nDouble bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 3,55m x 1.9m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising WC, wash hand basin, bath, separate shower, and heated towel rail.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.85m x 1.0m\nBright landing area featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a Velux window\n\nBedrooom 1 - 3.8m x 5.0m\nSpacious double bedroom featuring fitted wardrobes, a TV point, and laminate-effect timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.55m x 3.2m\nDouble bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring.\n\nStudy - 3.6m x 1.7m\nBright study room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a Velux window\n\nShower room - 2.2m x 2.4m\nInterconnected with Bedroom 1, this shower room features a WC, wash hand basin, and corner shower. Finished with tiled flooring, partially tiled walls, heated towel rail, and a Velux window\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nWell-maintained front garden with a gated side entrance, two designated car parking spaces, and additional visitor parking.\n\nRear Garden - \nSunny south-facing rear garden, partially fenced and partially walled, featuring a paved patio, artificial lawn, raised flower bed, shed, outdoor tap, and external lighting\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>5 bed, 3.5 bath, 3 story, double front, end of terrace</li><li>BER: 'A3'</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>uPVC Double Glazed Windows</li><li>Composite Front Door</li><li>Solar Panels</li><li>Ventilation</li><li>Alarm</li><li>2 x designated parking spaces </li><li>Cul de sac</li><li>South facing rear garden</li><li>Great condition</li><li>Built c.2017</li><li>Approx 156sqm/1,670 sqft</ul>"
      },
